SKUNKPORT: replaces the wlroots files installed by devel-wlroots (same prefix, same
version) with a build that includes the GLES2 renderer. dwl does not need rebuilding.
Needs skp/devel-mesa. Software rendering (softpipe) is slower than pixman and wlroots
refuses it unless WLR_RENDERER_ALLOW_SOFTWARE=1 is set. Real acceleration needs a
virtio GPU with 3D in the VM. To go back: hdx i -f devel-wlroots
